# Generating a pair of reflexive rules
#
# A property is marked reflexive. One N3 rule generates two backward rules
# that can answer self-link questions for the endpoints of that property.

@base <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/issue141/test1.n3> .
@prefix : <http://www.example.com/ns/ex#> .

# For each reflexive property, generate two backward rules: one for each
# endpoint of an existing link. The inner variables belong to those rules.
{
    ?p a :Reflexive
} => {
    {
        ?x ?p ?x
    } <= {
        ?x ?p ?y
    } .
    {
        ?y ?p ?y
    } <= {
        ?x ?p ?y
    } .
} .

# This declaration enables the generator for p.
:p a :Reflexive .
